ion bet of 300 chips accomplishes multiple goals: it builds the pot when I likely have the best hand, protects against draws by not giving free cards, and maintains my aggressive image from pre-flop. Checking would be too passive and could allow dangerous turn cards, while going all-in would be unnecessarily risky and poor value extraction.\n\nAnswer: 300"}
